# Lean / Lake build outputs
.lake/
build/
*.olean
*.ilean
*.trace

# Pandoc / LaTeX intermediate build artefacts.
# The compiled PDF and the generated LaTeX source are committed to
# the repository so that readers can access them directly without
# regenerating; the intermediate `combined.md` is excluded because
# it is a pure concatenation of the section files and provides no
# additional information.
paper/v2/combined.md
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.bbl
*.blg

# JAR build pipeline (Springer Nature template) — regenerated by
# `make jar-pdf`. The Pandoc-derived body fragments and the local
# bib symlink are not part of the source tree; main-jar.tex and
# main-jar.pdf ARE committed (canonical JAR-formatted artefacts).
paper/v2/jar-build/body.tex
paper/v2/jar-build/body-raw.tex
paper/v2/jar-build/references.bib
paper/v2/jar-build/sn-mathphys-num.bst

